# Protect cryptographic material from line-ending normalization.
# Git core.autocrlf=true would otherwise convert the PEM's CRLF to LF on
# commit, changing the committed blob SHA-256 and breaking the deterministic
# file_sha256_equals_json_field binding in both the reconciler (PR #603) and
# the Epoch 002 precollection preflight (scripts/prepare_track_a_epoch_002
# _precollection_preflight.py --check-custody), which produces:
#   EPOCH_002_PREFLIGHT_FAIL: custody certificate SHA-256 mismatch
